# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Generated build artifacts that are nonetheless committed (see README):
#  - smartmouse_bundle.h is #included by the firmware C++ build, which has no
#    Node toolchain, so it must be present to compile.
#  - smartmouse-cards.js is the built Lovelace bundle HA users copy into www/.
# Mark them so their large, minified diffs don't clutter reviews:
#  -diff              -> git shows "Binary files differ" instead of a text diff
#  linguist-generated -> GitHub collapses them in PRs and excludes from stats
# (matched by unique basename - gitattributes patterns can't contain the
#  spaces in these files' directory paths)
smartmouse_bundle.h -diff linguist-generated=true
smartmouse-cards.js -diff linguist-generated=true
